# Bayti TV's font is Tajawal (SIL OFL, committed in assets/fonts and the launcher's assets). UrTV's Thmanyah may only ship
# inside a built product: never commit a copy of it. urtv.html is built from what is committed (3 MB)
assets/fonts/Thmanyah*.woff2
android/launcher/src/main/assets/fonts/Thmanyah*.otf
dist/urtv.html
.fonts-private/
